{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-39035","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43866","text":"FleetPrompt — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-39036","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43867","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-43868","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-43869","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-43870","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-43871","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-43872","text":" Full Implementation (Phoenix + OTP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-39037","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43873","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39038","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43874","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-39039","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43875","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-43876","marks":["bold"],"text":"FleetPrompt"},{"id":"spn-43877","text":" — the open agent marketplace for the [&] Protocol ecosystem. FleetPrompt is the registry where production-ready AI agents are published, discovered, and deployed in one click. Every listed agent carries a versioned manifest, a computed trust score, declared permissions, and a linked SpecPrompt spec."}]},{"id":"blk-39040","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43878","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-43879","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-39041","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43880","text":"FleetPrompt is the "},{"id":"spn-43881","marks":["bold"],"text":"distribution layer"},{"id":"spn-43882","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-39042","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-39043","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43883","text":"FleetPrompt is also the "},{"id":"spn-43884","marks":["bold"],"text":"canonical trust broker"},{"id":"spn-43885","text":" of the [&] ecosystem — it aggregates PRISM CL scores, test coverage, usage data, and audit quality into a single trust score."}]},{"id":"blk-39044","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43886","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39045","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43887","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-39046","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8+ (LiveView for real-time search, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migration range 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nAudit:        Broadway pipeline (batched, append-only)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTelemetry:    :telemetry + Prometheus\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-39047","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43888","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39048","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43889","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-39049","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43890","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-43891","marks":["code"],"text":"fleetprompt.com/"},{"id":"spn-43892","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-39050","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"fleetprompt.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── fleet_prompt/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex               # FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent schema (fleet.agents)\n│   │   ├── manifests/\n│   │   │   └── manifest.ex            # FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest schema (fleet.manifests)\n│   │   ├── publishers/\n│   │   │   └── publisher.ex           # FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher schema (fleet.publishers)\n│   │   ├── installs/\n│   │   │   └── install.ex             # FleetPrompt.Installs.Install schema (fleet.installs)\n│   │   ├── trust/\n│   │   │   ├── engine.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustEngine — 4-signal score computation\n│   │   │   ├── worker.ex              # FleetPrompt.TrustWorker — GenServer per agent\n│   │   │   └── supervisor.ex          # FleetPrompt.TrustSupervisor — DynamicSupervisor\n│   │   ├── registry.ex                # FleetPrompt.Registry — manifest CRUD, version management\n│   │   ├── search/\n│   │   │   ├── index.ex               # FleetPrompt.SearchIndex — pg_trgm + ts_vector management\n│   │   │   └── query.ex               # FleetPrompt.Search — search query builder\n│   │   ├── forks.ex                   # FleetPrompt.Forks — fork-and-customize workflow\n│   │   ├── install_engine.ex          # FleetPrompt.InstallEngine — deploy orchestration\n│   │   ├── audit_writer.ex            # FleetPrompt.AuditWriter — Broadway append-only audit\n│   │   ├── webhook_dispatcher.ex      # FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher — Oban async webhooks\n│   │   ├── pipeline_intake.ex         # FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake — dark factory event handler\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex              # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 11)\n│   │       └── tools.ex               # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── fleet_prompt.ex                # Application entry point\n│   └── fleet_prompt_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                  # Phoenix router\n│       ├── live/\n│       │   ├── search_live.ex         # LiveView — agent search (⌘K)\n│       │   ├── agent_detail_live.ex   # LiveView — agent detail + manifest\n│       │   ├── trust_dashboard_live.ex # LiveView — trust score dashboard\n│       │   └── publisher_live.ex      # LiveView — publisher profile\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── api_controller.ex      # REST API for programmatic access\n│           └── webhook_controller.ex  # POST /api/pipeline/intake (CloudEvents)\n├── test/\n│   ├── trust/\n│   │   ├── engine_test.exs\n│   │   └── worker_test.exs\n│   ├── search/\n│   │   ├── index_test.exs\n│   │   └── query_test.exs\n│   ├── pipeline_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── forks_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_manifest.json\n│       └── consolidation_event.json\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-39051","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43893","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-39052","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43894","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-39053","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43895","text":"Phase 1: Core Registry (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-39054","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43896","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43897","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-43898","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config, LiveView 2. "},{"id":"spn-43899","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-43900","text":" (sections 3-4)"}]},{"id":"blk-39055","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39057","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43901","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Publishers.Publisher"},{"id":"spn-43902","text":" with workspace_id, user_id (Supabase Auth)"}]}],"id":"blk-39056","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39059","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43903","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-43904","text":" with workspace_id, search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-39058","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39061","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43905","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Manifests.Manifest"},{"id":"spn-43906","text":" with all fields from section 4.1"}]}],"id":"blk-39060","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39063","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43907","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Installs.Install"},{"id":"spn-43908","text":" with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-39062","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39065","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43909","text":"Audit events schema with workspace_id"}]}],"id":"blk-39064","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39066","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43910","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-43911","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Registry"},{"id":"spn-43912","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43913","marks":["code"],"text":"registry.ex"},{"id":"spn-43914","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39067","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39069","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43915","text":"Manifest CRUD with version immutability"}]}],"id":"blk-39068","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39071","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43916","text":"Version management (semver enforcement)"}]}],"id":"blk-39070","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39073","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43917","text":"Status transitions: draft → published → deprecated → yanked"}]}],"id":"blk-39072","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39074","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43918","text":"4. "},{"id":"spn-43919","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement ETS caches"}]},{"id":"blk-39075","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39077","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43920","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_manifests"},{"id":"spn-43921","text":" — agent_id:version → manifest map"}]}],"id":"blk-39076","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39079","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43922","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_trust_scores"},{"id":"spn-43923","text":" — agent_id → {score, computed_at}"}]}],"id":"blk-39078","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39081","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43924","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_search_index"},{"id":"spn-43925","text":" — trigram → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-39080","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39083","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43926","marks":["code"],"text":":fp_categories"},{"id":"spn-43927","text":" — category_slug → [agent_id]"}]}],"id":"blk-39082","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39084","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43928","text":"Phase 2: Trust Engine (weeks 4-8)"}]},{"id":"blk-39085","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43929","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43930","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustEngine"},{"id":"spn-43931","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43932","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-43933","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39086","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39088","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43934","text":"4 weighted signals: test_coverage (30%), spec_compliance (25%), usage_history (25%), audit_quality (20%)"}]}],"id":"blk-39087","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39090","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43935","marks":["code"],"text":"compute/1"},{"id":"spn-43936","text":" → integer 0-100"}]}],"id":"blk-39089","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39092","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43937","text":"Individual signal computations from section 5.1"}]}],"id":"blk-39091","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39093","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43938","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-43939","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustWorker"},{"id":"spn-43940","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43941","marks":["code"],"text":"trust/worker.ex"},{"id":"spn-43942","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39094","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39096","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43943","text":"GenServer per agent"}]}],"id":"blk-39095","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39098","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43944","text":"Computes initial score on publish"}]}],"id":"blk-39097","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39100","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43945","text":"Recomputes on new data (installs, test results, audits)"}]}],"id":"blk-39099","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39102","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43946","text":"Caches in ETS"}]}],"id":"blk-39101","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39104","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43947","text":"Broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],"id":"blk-39103","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39106","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43948","text":"Hibernates after 5 minutes inactivity"}]}],"id":"blk-39105","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39107","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43949","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-43950","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement TrustSupervisor"},{"id":"spn-43951","text":" — DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]},{"id":"blk-39108","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43952","text":"Phase 3: Search (weeks 6-10)"}]},{"id":"blk-39109","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43953","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43954","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement full-text search"},{"id":"spn-43955","text":" (section 8)"}]},{"id":"blk-39110","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39112","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43956","text":"ts_vector generated column on agents (name A, description B, tags C)"}]}],"id":"blk-39111","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39114","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43957","text":"pg_trgm fuzzy matching indexes"}]}],"id":"blk-39113","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39116","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43958","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search.search/2"},{"id":"spn-43959","text":" with filters: min_trust, category, runtime, limit"}]}],"id":"blk-39115","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39118","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43960","text":"Ranking: ts_rank descending, then trust_score descending"}]}],"id":"blk-39117","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39119","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43961","text":"Phase 4: Publish Pipeline (weeks 8-12)"}]},{"id":"blk-39120","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43962","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43963","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement publish flow"},{"id":"spn-43964","text":" (section 6)"}]},{"id":"blk-39121","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39123","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43965","text":"Manifest validation → spec validation → duplicate check → trust computation → index update → audit + notify"}]}],"id":"blk-39122","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39125","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43966","text":"Version immutability enforcement"}]}],"id":"blk-39124","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39127","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43967","text":"Yank support (hides from search, preserves record)"}]}],"id":"blk-39126","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43968","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-43969","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement AuditWriter"},{"id":"spn-43970","text":" — Broadway pipeline for batched audit writes 3. "},{"id":"spn-43971","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement WebhookDispatcher"},{"id":"spn-43972","text":" — Oban worker for async webhook delivery with retry/backoff"}]},{"id":"blk-39129","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43973","text":"Phase 5: Install Pipeline (weeks 10-14)"}]},{"id":"blk-39130","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43974","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43975","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement install flow"},{"id":"spn-43976","text":" (section 7)"}]},{"id":"blk-39131","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43977","text":"Permission review → Delegatic policy check → MCP dependency resolution → OpenSentience deploy → Graphonomous connect → audit + confirm"}]}],"id":"blk-39132","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43978","text":"2. "},{"id":"spn-43979","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement InstallEngine"},{"id":"spn-43980","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43981","marks":["code"],"text":"install_engine.ex"},{"id":"spn-43982","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-39135","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39137","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43983","text":"Permission sandboxing (section 7.2)"}]}],"id":"blk-39136","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39139","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43984","text":"Delegatic org-level denylists"}]}],"id":"blk-39138","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39140","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43985","text":"3. "},{"id":"spn-43986","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Fork System"},{"id":"spn-43987","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43988","marks":["code"],"text":"forks.ex"},{"id":"spn-43989","text":") — section 9"}]},{"id":"blk-39141","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39143","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43990","text":"Fork creates new agent under forker's account"}]}],"id":"blk-39142","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39145","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43991","marks":["code"],"text":"forked_from"},{"id":"spn-43992","text":" provenance tracking"}]}],"id":"blk-39144","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43993","text":"Trust score starts at 0 for forks"}]}],"id":"blk-39146","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-39148","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-43994","text":"Phase 6: Dark Factory Pipeline Intake (weeks 12-16)"}]},{"id":"blk-39149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-43995","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-43996","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineIntake"},{"id":"spn-43997","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-43998","marks":["code"],"text":"pipeline_intake.ex"},{"id":"spn-43999","text":") — section 10.2"}]},{"id":"blk-39150","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44000","text":"Accept "},{"id":"spn-44001","marks":["code"],"text":"ConsolidationEvent"},{"id":"spn-44002","text":" from Agentelic at "},{"id":"spn-44003","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /api/pipeline/intake"}]}],"id":"blk-39151","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-39154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-44004","text":"Event validation: CloudEvents envelope, workspace_id, artifact_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-39153","kind":"list-